        "content": "## ⚡ Discord Public Community Channels & Developer Question Miner\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nIndex public Discord community announcements and developer pain points into a searchable knowledge base or Slack digest.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/discord-public-server-channels-messages-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/discord-public-server-channels-messages-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Discord Public Channels & Community Scraper** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
